  "question": {
    "html": "<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"A\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B\"></span> are the two endpoints of a rod. <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span> is a point on the rod between <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"A\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B\"></span>. A constant force <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> is applied to the rod at point <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B\"></span>, causing the rod to rotate about point <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B\"></span>. </p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>The angle between the rod and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\theta\"></span>. The net torque on the rod is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\tau\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The following changes can be made to the system:</p>\n<p>I. Decrease <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\theta\"></span>.</p>\n<p>II. Reverse the direction of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span>.</p>\n<p>III. Move the point of application of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> from <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B\"></span> to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span>.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Which of these changes will cause the magnitude of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\tau\"></span> to decrease? </p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\">I and II only</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\">I and III only</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\">II and III only</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\">I, II and III</li>\n</ol>"
  },
